From 0e64dd26f58f95992be6788bd38b8e14454130bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 07:53:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pop-up before opening: honour the start date, block ordering,
 count down to opening

A pop-up with a future start date fell through to its weekly hours, so the app
showed the next weekly slot as the reopen time and kept pre-ordering on.

hours.getStatus now treats an upcoming pop-up (before startDate) as closed:
open/canOrderNow/preorder all false (no pre-order even with PREORDER_ENABLED), so
checkout is blocked until opening day; nextOpen is anchored to the START DATE's
first session, and a new opening field carries the date, label and days-until.

Customer app, when the chosen store is an upcoming pop-up: the closed banner
becomes 'Opening soon - We open <date>' with a live countdown (no Pre-order
button), the order-type bar is hidden, and the cart badge reads 'Opens <date>'.
